{
 "format": "doorprints-school-vectors/1",
 "note": "The hidden schools kind (kinds PR 5, S4b-BL-209; docs/03 ADR-36 §18.9): what docs/schemas/kinds/school.json resolves to, in the shape of kind-vectors.json (`kind`); what the typed-extras renderer draws for it per stack, in the shape of kind-field-vectors.json (`fields`, `rows`; a school has no money of its own, so its Details extras have rows of their own instead of the price's); and one school candidate that every stack keeps unchanged through its stores, its sync and its backups: `backup` is a doorprints-backup/1 file whose `candidates` each stack reads and writes back byte for byte, and `candidate` is the same school on the wire (`/api/candidates`, the Drive sync file, the website's IndexedDB) that each stack's mapping writes back as it came. The house's vectors and samples are unchanged. Written from school.json and the dictionaries on the branch feat/kinds-7-schools-kind; hi, ta and te are under review. Readers: web school-kind.spec.ts and school-kind-file.spec.ts, the server's SchoolKindTest and SchoolCandidateApiTest, and the phone's SchoolKindVectorsTest (:shared), SchoolKindScreensTest (:ui) and SchoolSampleTest (:app). Change a case only with the change it pins.",
